  "articleBody": "Before shower tile is installed, confirm the layout, remove unsuitable surfaces, prepare a stable backing, install a compatible waterproofing system, slope the shower floor toward the drain, set tile with appropriate mortar, and finish joints with suitable sealants. Do not treat grout as the waterproof layer; the concealed assembly must manage water before tile is placed.",
